vtorrent (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Full BitTorrent protocol support
  * DHT (Distributed Hash Table) for trackerless torrents
  * Magnet link support with protocol handler registration
  * Modern Avalonia-based user interface
  * Light and dark theme support
  * Intelligent bandwidth management and scheduling
  * Sequential downloading option for media files
  * Peer exchange (PEX) support
  * uTP protocol support for network-friendly transfers
  * IP filtering and encryption support

 -- vTorrent Developers <developers@vtorrent.example.com>  Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
